Define CS_StudioIndentStyle         for "IndentStyle"
Define CS_StudioTabSize             for "TabSize"
Define CS_StudioEditorSettingsStart for "DataFlex Studio"
Define CS_StudioEditorSettingsEnd   for "Code Editor Settings"
