/* THE DATABASE VERSION THIS CODE NEEDS - the pnVersionNumber of the newest DUF_MultipleTablesX_X.pkg that
   DUFUpdateProgram.src Uses. Bump it together with that Use line: a program whose database is older runs
   DUFUpdateProgram64.exe at startup (DoDatabaseUpdateStuff.pkg; UnitTests.src). It was a literal 1.7 in
   DoDatabaseUpdateStuff.pkg while the updater was at 1.8, so a 1.7 database never got 1.8 (2026-11-27). */
Define CN_DbVersionNeeded for 1.8

